        "Content": "Barry Auctioneers & Valuers are delighted to present to the market this impressive three-bedroom mid-terraced property, ideally located in the mature and sought-after residential area of Churchfield on Cork’s north side.\r\n\r\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and benefits from a number of attractive features, including private driveway parking and a convenient side entrance.\r\n\r\nSituated in a well-established residential area, the property is ideally positioned close to a range of local amenities, schools, shops and transport links, while also providing easy access to Cork City Centre."
